0result.sql is preferable because it  
• counts DISTINCT fdic_certificate_number, guaranteeing each institution is counted once even if multiple snapshots exist;  
• restricts to 5‑digit ZIP codes with LENGTH(zip_code)=5, excluding incomplete or malformed ZIPs.  

These refinements make the query more robust while still returning the same winning ZIP code (33131).